WEBVTT

00:00:01.843 --> 00:00:02.967
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:00:03.439 --> 00:00:04.546
What are those?

00:00:05.064 --> 00:00:06.302
<v><b>Man:</b></v> They’re T-shirts.

00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:08.247
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> How much are they?

00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:10.313
<v><b>Man:</b></v> They’re £15.

00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:13.629
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> And how much are these key rings?

00:00:14.319 --> 00:00:15.555
<v><b>Man:</b></v> They’re £6.

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.468
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> And this mug?

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.168
<v><b>Man:</b></v> £14.

00:00:20.752 --> 00:00:23.420
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Is that a Manchester United shirt?

00:00:24.169 --> 00:00:26.122
<v><b>Man:</b></v> No, it’s Arsenal.

00:00:27.386 --> 00:00:28.698
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> How much is it?

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.586
<v><b>Man:</b></v> £25.

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:33.031
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Oh…no.

00:00:33.287 --> 00:00:35.249
Thank you. Bye.